  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm David Gerbino. I work in fintech and build data products solo on
    nights and weekends, using AI-assisted development end to end — from an
    Android phone, a tablet, and a Chromebook, all in the browser.
  </p>
  <p>
    Two products are live: <a href="https://ndfi-tracker.com">NDFI Tracker</a>,
    which monitors U.S. bank lending exposure to non-depository financial
    institutions across 4,500+ banks using FFIEC call report data, and
    <a href="https://fintechnewsletters.com">Fintech Newsletters</a>, a curated
    directory of fintech newsletters.
  </p>
  <p>
    I also run a <a href="/research">recurring research program</a> covering
    DMARC email authentication adoption, AI answer engine visibility (GEO),
    and search visibility (SEO) across banks, credit unions, and neobanks,
    plus a monthly visualization project built on BLS unemployment data.
  </p>
